EFFECT_SOURCE_TRACE {"repeat":2,"variant":"unshared-rows","revision":"a8bbe0984f270070eba9bc166a89909d0c67597e","meta":{"revision":"a8bbe0984f270070eba9bc166a89909d0c67597e","tree":"5ba71a79d061ac81cf374f25559af746edadaa60","submodules":"0b6ebeeec827b05210f3acfa4149a70dda9a0de5 vendor/gdp-ts (0b6ebee)\n d47141cce2caf5b86b0c2c0c372a5174f424bc15 vendor/handwired (d47141c)","clean":true},"experimental":true,"before":"d4006a262a1c68e7ef74f4233ba3f39ea447516696a3f6de4ae62f2e44f29af7","after":"d4006a262a1c68e7ef74f4233ba3f39ea447516696a3f6de4ae62f2e44f29af7","nativeKernel":"7ec8b310d23fab7eb3ba452b659e7051ceefe97aea01ffa6f16d990a7bea7f33","rowsShared":"0","outcome":{"ms":32005.135401000003,"exit":0,"rules":[{"entry":"make","ok":true,"notes":["jobs is an Effect 4 Queue (bounded, 4 items), modelled: jobs_items, jobs_head, jobs_tail, jobs_open; it holds the items at jobs_head .. jobs_tail - 1, oldest first; an offer to it full waits; a take from it empty waits","workers is an Effect 4 Semaphore of 2 permits, modelled: workers_taken, the permits taken, and workers_held, those the calling fiber holds (its takes less its releases; under many fibers each fiber's, summing to workers_taken); a take waits until they are free, a release gives them back unchecked (as Effect does); withPermits is the take, its body's statements, the release (a failure in the body releasing first)","calls from many fibers at once: work is 4 steps (each transaction or Ref operation one), the fibers interleaving them: the rule is every fiber's (lift: each fiber's place and what it carries a map keyed by the input fiber, the service's Refs (jobs_head, jobs_tail, workers_taken, spent) shared); each other method is one step. A request is one fiber's next step: a fiber in the middle of a call takes its next step whatever method the request names. A failure in a later step ends the call as a return does. A law reads the service's Refs","make is an Effect service: its state is its Refs, each method an event, a failure the step's refusal; each method is one step, which holds where calls don't interleave (one at a time, or under a Semaphore of 1)","make makes an object of functions: its state is what they close over (jobs_items, jobs_head, jobs_tail, jobs_open, workers_taken, workers_held, spent, __gdp_pc, __gdp_work_cost), its arguments the params","a transaction that waits (STM.check, STM.retry, Effect.txRetry) is not taken until a TRef it read changes: the rule refuses the request (it is taken later as a new one)","submit_cost: an integer (the code takes any whole number)","workers_taken: an integer (a step may take it below 0, or it starts there)","workers_held: an integer (a step may take it below 0, or it starts there)","spent: an integer (a step may take it below 0, or it starts there)","__gdp_work_cost: an integer (a step may take it below 0, or it starts there)","backlog_result: an integer (a step may take it below 0, or it starts there)","lemma proven, beside every law: workers: what its fibers hold is never below nothing","lemma not proven (left out): workers: no fiber gives back more permits than it took"],"laws":[{"name":"every job waiting costs 1 to 10","expr":"forall k in jobs_items: (jobs_head <= k and k < jobs_tail) implies (1 <= jobs_items[k] and jobs_items[k] <= 10)","where":"effect-pool.ts:9","kind":"law","verdict":"proven","ms":252},{"name":"the work done never goes negative","expr":"spent >= 0","where":"effect-pool.ts:10","kind":"law","verdict":"proven","ms":225},{"name":"no permit is given back that wasn't taken","expr":"workers_taken >= 0","where":"effect-pool.ts:11","kind":"law","verdict":"proven","ms":203}]}]},"exit":0,"signal":null,"wallMs":32156.284545000002,"resources":{"telemetryVersion":2,"label":"trace-2-unshared-rows","strictSeconds":300,"before":{"at":"2026-11-10T00:52:23.925Z","uptime":"2522.18 16484.47","memory":{"MemTotal":16375780,"MemFree":845560,"MemAvailable":13195276,"Buffers":439308,"Cached":11562424,"SwapCached":48,"Active":31120